data: {"id": "f77a45f9b0a447de-final", "run_id": "f77a45f9b0a447de", "seq": 1130, "ts_ms": 1789355942968, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` | CrashLoopBackOff | Container resource limit (Memory: 96Mi) is too low for the application workload, causing OOMKilled (Exit Code 137) and subsequent CrashLoopBackOff. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | K8s State | `container.resource_limit.memory` = 96Mi | 明确容器内存硬限制极低，构成 OOM 触发条件 |\n| 2 | K8s State | K8s Event | `event.reason=BackOff`, `message=\"Back-off restarting failed container\"` (x176) | 确认系统因崩溃持续退避重启，符合 CrashLoopBackOff 行为 |\n| 3 | K8s State | K8s Event | `event.reason=Killing`, `message=\"Container app failed liveness probe, will be restarted\"` | 证实容器健康检查失败直接触发了 kill 动作 |\n| 4 | K8s State | K8s Event | `exit_code` = 137, `reason` = `Error` | Exit Code 137 确证进程被 Linux OOM Killer 强制终止 |\n| 5 | K8s State | K8s State | `restart_count` = 19, `status` = Running | 量化重启规模，确认处于频繁重启循环中 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: CrashLoopBackOff) = 1 | 指标层同步验证了 Pod 当前处于等待重启的崩溃状态 |\n| 7 | Logging | Elasticsearch | Pattern: `request completed`, path: `/work`, `http_status`: 200, trace_ids: [\"273c96...\", \"f313...\", ...] | 确认应用本身具备处理正常请求的能力，崩溃具有间歇性而非服务逻辑损坏 |\n| 8 | Tracing | Deepflow | Flow: `GET /work`, src: `172.16.104.33`, dst: `172.16.104.34`, duration: 12ms-29ms | 确认网络通路与正常响应延迟，进一步排除网络侧原因 |\n\n证据间逻辑印证：K8s 层面 Exit Code 137 与低内存限制（96Mi）结合，确凿指向内存超限导致的 OOM 崩溃。Liveness Probe 失败是容器被杀的直接触发器。Logging 和 Tracing 证明在崩溃间隙应用能正常响应流量，排除了代码层面的持续阻塞或逻辑死锁，符合内存不稳定（如内存泄漏或峰值占用过高）引发间歇性 OOM 的特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n容器内存限制过低 (96Mi) → 应用内存使用突破阈值触发 OOM Killer → Pod 状态变更为 CrashLoopBackOff → Liveness 探针探测失败并持续退避重启\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n**根因已确认**。容器 `app` 的内存资源限制被硬限制在 **96Mi**，该资源额度无法满足当前应用工作负载（workload）的正常运行需求。当应用运行期间内存消耗超过 96Mi 时，Linux 内核 OOM Killer 介入并强制终止进程，导致 Exit Code 137。进程终止导致容器重启，触发 Liveness Probe 失败（HTTP 500 / 连接中断），进而引发 Kubernetes 退避重启机制（BackOff）。证据 [1] 定义了低水位限制，证据 [4] 提供了 OOM 的底层信号，证据 [2] 和 [6] 描述了由此引发的系统级故障循环。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 51.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r: 51.7s (Evidence 43.5s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 80.535, "metrics": {"run_id": "f77a45f9b0a447de", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 80.54091787338257, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 80540.91787338257, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 76543.88666152954, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9600.7821559906, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3631.4165592193604}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 17338.49787712097, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 51702.96764373779, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11478.718519210815, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

